<title>USA: OM Group to replace Fay's in index.</title>
<headline>OM Group to replace Fay's in index.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard &amp; Poor's said on Friday it will replace Fay's Inc in the S&amp;P SmallCap 600 Index with OM Group Inc after the close of trading on October 11, 1996.</p>
<p>Fay's is being acquired by J.C. Penney Co Inc, a component of the S&amp;P 500 Index. Fay's shareholders are scheduled to vote on the merger on that date, Standard &amp; Poor's said.</p>
<p>OM Group produces metal-based specialty chemicals, Standard &amp; Poor's said.</p>
